wers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "9238e0306441c181f77698e7e74dc04e30347b34", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/simpleusd/istio/commits/9238e0306441c181f77698e7e74dc04e30347b34", "html_url": "https://github.com/simpleusd/istio/commit/9238e0306441c181f77698e7e74dc04e30347b34"}]}, {"sha": "9c8ca47b64fa2d152f6a1d3027f25d38246210c5", "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0NDkwMDM3MzExOjljOGNhNDdiNjRmYTJkMTUyZjZhMWQzMDI3ZjI1ZDM4MjQ2MjEwYzU=", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Steven Dake", "email": "stdake@cisco.com", "date": "2018-10-17T00:35:43Z"}, "committer": {"name": "istio-bot", "email": "istio.testing@gmail.com", "date": "2018-10-17T00:35:43Z"}, "message": "Create subcharts to enable helm dep update (#9306)\n\n* Create subcharts to enable helm dep update\n\nTechnical changes:\n\n- helm dep update is defective with the current umbrella model.\n- helm dep update is required to introduce third party charts into\n  the helm installation.\n- helm dep update is required to introduce a minimum pinned version\n  for the various CNI use cases that are emerging in the community.\n- requirements for `repository: file://` cannot be subdirectories\n  of the main helm chart.  To enable helm dep udpate, the components\n  must be moved to a subdirectory (in this PR subcharts).\n- nodeagent version was incorrectly specified as 1.0.0.\n- This PR simply moves around subcharts so that helm dep update is\n  usable.\n\nThe main goal of this PR is to enable CNI components to be released\nindependently of the main 3 month cadence for Istio.  This would permit\na dev/alpha/beta/stable release of CNI between 1.1.0 and 1.2.0.  As\nother components become available, they could also be released independently\nof the 3 month cadence in dev/alpha/beta for technical preview by operators\nevaluating Istio.\n\nThis PR may have workflow impact for developers.  With our distribution of\nHelm charts via istio.io, there is no impact for operators.\n\n* Add `helm dep update` to tests", "tree": {"sha": "7c9fa0b26cc2743b917568831b27e8ac13be7713", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/simpleusd/istio/git/trees/7c9fa0b26cc2743b917568831b27e8ac13be7713"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/simpleusd/istio/git/commits/9c8ca47b64fa2d152f6a1d3027f25d38246210c5", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/simpleusd/istio/commits/9c8ca47b64fa2d152f6a1d3027f25d38246210c5", "html_url": "https://github.com/simpleusd/istio/commit/9c8ca47b64fa2d152f6a1d3027f25d38246210c5", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/simpleusd/istio/commits/9c8ca47b64fa2d152f6a1d3027f25d38246210c5/comments", "author": null, "committer": {"login": "istio-testing", "id": 25311884, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzExODg0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25311884?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing", "html_url": "https://github.com/istio-testing", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/istio-testing/starred{/owner}{/repo